ased.'=>'Dodatak %s je uspešno kupljen.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Vaš %s dodatni paket je uspešno nadograđen.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'%s besplatni probni period je uspešno otkazan. Pošto je dodatak isključivo premijum, automatski je deaktiviran. Ako želite da ga koristite u budućnosti, moraćete da kupite licencu.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s ne može da radi bez dodatka.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ne može da radi bez %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Samo da vas obavestimo da se informacije o dodacima za %s preuzimaju sa spoljnog servera.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Dodaci modula %s','Address Line %d'=>'Adresa red %d','Affiliate'=>'Партнер','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Zbog kršenja naših uslova affiliate programa, odlučili smo da privremeno blokiramo vaš affiliate nalog. Ako imate bilo kakvih pitanja, obratite se podršci.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Vaš partnerski nalog je privremeno suspendovan.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Vaša partnerska prijava za %1$s je prihvaćena! Prijavite se u svoju partnersku oblast na: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Hvala vam što ste se prijavili za naš partnerski program, ali nažalost, odlučili smo da u ovom trenutku odbijemo vašu prijavu. Pokušajte ponovo za 30 dana.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details durin